{
  "run_id": "PMC11355469__problem_constrained__pcd_CD_o3mini__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The baseline is an as-deposited FeNiCrCoCu HEA coating on a conventional metal substrate without a deliberately pre-formed oxide scale.",
      "field": "material_initial_state; baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short exposure at approximately 700°C in a mildly oxidizing atmosphere will form an oxide film on the FeNiCrCoCu coating.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::028::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC9960858::web::012::3_2_friction_coefficient"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation treatment will produce a continuous, nanometer-scale, adherent film integrated with the HEA surface.",
      "field": "hypothesis; structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-formed film will consist primarily of Cr2O3 and related spinel phases.",
      "field": "hypothesis; structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC10384371::web::028::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC10384371::web::030::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr2O3 can act as a compact protective oxide barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC10384371::web::030::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed oxide scale will remain stable during sliding in air at 600–700°C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film will reduce direct adhesive metal-metal contact during sliding.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxide film formed on an HEA surface can lubricate the sliding interface, reduce interfacial shear strength, and lower friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::012::3_2_friction_coefficient"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-formed oxide scale will redistribute shear stresses during sliding.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxide film that lowers interfacial shear strength can inhibit plastic deformation caused by repeated sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::012::3_2_friction_coefficient"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed surface modification will reduce localized adhesive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed surface modification will reduce microcrack formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidized coating will have a lower wear rate than the untreated coating at 600–700°C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidized coating will exhibit less severe microscopic plastic deformation than the untreated coating.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::012::3_2_friction_coefficient"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidized coating will exhibit a more spatially uniform microscopic deformation pattern than the untreated coating.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective effect may be lost if sliding stresses exceed the oxide film's adhesion strength or if the film degrades during extended cycling.",
      "field": "boundary; uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wear rate, friction coefficient, wear-track chemistry, oxide integrity, and deformation patterns can be compared between identically tested pre-oxidized and untreated coatings.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.design; falsification_experiment.measurements",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure to obtain lower wear and less severe or more uniform deformation, or rapid oxide spallation, is specified as falsifying the hypothesis.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
